ole=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Run up a tree to the moon.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/fc/Run_up_a_tree_to_the_moon..png/revision/latest?cb=20210401210844\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Run up a tree to the moon.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/fc/Run_up_a_tree_to_the_moon..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210401210844\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/fc/Run_up_a_tree_to_the_moon..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210401210844 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/fc/Run_up_a_tree_to_the_moon..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210401210844 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Run up a tree to the moon.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Run_up_a_tree_to_the_moon..png\" data-image-name=\"Run up a tree to the moon..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_11\" title=\"Series 11\">11</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sarah_Kendall\" title=\"Sarah Kendall\">Sarah Kendall</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Lure_of_the_Treacle_Puppies.\" title=\"The Lure of the Treacle Puppies.\">The Lure of the Treacle Puppies.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Premature_conker.\" title=\"Premature conker.\">Premature conker.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Run up a tree to the moon.</b></i> is the third episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_11\" title=\"Series 11\">Series 11</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 1 April 2021. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Sarah_Kendall\" title=\"Sarah Kendall\">Sarah Kendall</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Run_up_a_tree_to_the_moon.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Run up a tree to the moon\" was something that <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> suggested that <a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Ritchie\" title=\"Charlotte Ritchie\">Charlotte Ritchie</a> would be able to do, if she could \"run faster that gravity\", as she had attempted to do during the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_sauna_stones_hiss\" title=\"Make the sauna stones hiss\">Make the sauna stones hiss</a> task. The title card for the episode references <a href=\"/wiki/Sarah_Kendall\" title=\"Sarah Kendall\">Sarah Kendall</a>'s attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/Create_the_best_new_way_to_remember_how_many_days_each_of_the_months_has\" title=\"Create the best new way to remember how many days each of the months has\">Create the best new way to remember how many days each of the months has</a> task, with her acronym JAMJOD SNAJ, with the remaining two letters being M for May and F for February.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Run_up_a_tree_to_the_moon.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Løb op ad et træ tilmånen', which translates as 'Run up a tree to the moon'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Puuta pitkin kuuhun', which translates as 'Up a tree to the moon'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Säkerhetskontroll utom kontroll', which translates as 'Security check out of control'. This is a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Get_all_of_your_luggage_through_security\" title=\"Get all of your luggage through security\">Get all of your luggage through security</a> task.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Løp opp et tre til månen', which translates as 'Run up a tree to the moon'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Run_up_a_tree_to_the_moon.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Ritchie\" title=\"Charlotte Ritchie\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Charlotte Ritchie</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jamali_Maddix\" title=\"Jamali Maddix\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jamali Maddix</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lee_Mack\" title=\"Lee Mack\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lee Mack</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mike_Wozniak\" title=\"Mike Wozniak\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mike Wozniak</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sarah_Kendall\" title=\"Sarah Kendall\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sarah Kendall</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_shocking_thing_that_is_bigger_than_a_cat_but_smaller_than_a_pig\" title=\"Most shocking thing that is bigger than a cat but smaller than a pig\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most shocking thing bigger than a cat but smaller than a pig.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_sauna_stones_hiss\" title=\"Make the sauna stones hiss\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the sauna stones hiss. You must be standing behind the rope when the sauna stones hiss. You may not move the sauna stones or this rope. You may not use a hose.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Create_the_best_new_to_remember_how_many_days_each_of_the_months_has\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Create the best new to remember how many days each of the months has\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Create the best new way to remember how many days each of the months has.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_all_of_your_luggage_through_security\" title=\"Get all of your luggage through security\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Get all of your luggage through security. You must stay inside the maze until your luggage has been through the x-ray machine. You may go under one rope, and release one rope. You may also disconnect one pole completely, but you must then pick up that pole and carry it for the rest of the task. If any of your luggage touches any of the barriers, the maze will restart and you must start again.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Act_out_a_nursery_rhyme_for_the_Taskmaster_to_guess\" title=\"Act out a nursery rhyme for the Taskmaster to guess\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team Live:</b> Act out a nursery rhyme for the Taskmaster to guess. You must remain silent and on your spots throughout.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>11\n</td>\n<td>11\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>20</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Run_up_a_tree_to_the_moon.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/run-tree-moon\"><i>Run up a tree to the moon.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/70912-003\"><i>Run up a tree to the moon.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141506\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.114 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.163 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 662/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26002/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 176/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800559/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   98.309      1 -total\n 50.54%   49.690      1 Template:Spoilers\n 48.65%   47.830      1 Template:MessageBox\n 24.52%   24.109      1 Template:Episode_infobox\n 19.26%   18.932      1 Template:Episodes\n 11.41%   11.218     10 Templa